 "formulas": {
  "book": "n=12: n_lo=n_hi=4, median rank 6, w = min(0.5/4, 0.30) = 0.125; hysteresis: flat enters its entry zone; held side flips ONLY when its rank crosses beyond the median",
  "control_share": "up-row aggregate = 200(or 150/125/110/200 by regime)+700+1000 = 2285; down-row = 11*100+1000 = 2100; SH_s = mean over 28 rows = (up_level/2285 + down_level/2100)/2 per symbol",
  "descending_presentation": "the control's frozen 'rank DESCENDING on SH_s' is carried as ranks_desc (rank 1 = highest share, AVERAGE ranks for ties -- the repo-wide Spearman convention) while the BOOK is long lowest-share / short highest-share (ascending-value orientation)",
  "slope": "with 8 zero-amplitude symbols and 4 phase-aligned alternating dlog amplitudes c_i, M_s(d) = (C - c_s) z_d / 11 (z = +/-1 alternating), so slope_s = Cov(c_s z, (C-c_s) z/11)/Var((C-c_s) z/11) = 11 c_s / (C - c_s) with C = ln2+ln1.5+ln1.25+ln1.1; zero-variance own paths give slope exactly 0.0"
 },
